    <!-- About Project -->
    <string name="about_text">This project is designed as a native Android application for Karnataka\'s small-scale rubber plantation owners. Using a fine-tuned MobileNetV2 architecture running completely offline, the system accurately detects 8 major classes of rubber leaves (Anthracnose, Abnormal Leaf Fall, Powdery Mildew, Leaf Spot, Leaf Blight, Black Spot, Dry Leaf, and Healthy). It leverages OpenCV for on-device HSV-based infection severity assessment, and computes local Grad-CAM saliency heatmaps to visually explain the neural network\'s focus area.</string>
